# CHECKSUMS.md5 - the single manifest for this repo
#
# There is ONE CHECKSUMS.sha256 and ONE CHECKSUMS.md5, both here at the
# root, both repo-relative.  The six per-directory copies that used to
# sit under OUT/ and toolkit/ are retired to attic/checksums/ - see
# APPLY.txt, "ONE CHECKSUM MANIFEST, NOT SEVEN".  Do not add new ones;
# 'CLEANUP STRAY' reports any that appear.
#
# Verify from the repo root:
#
#     md5sum -c CHECKSUMS.md5          (or: CLEANUP VERIFY, on Windows)
#
# Every path appears exactly ONCE, with its CURRENT hash.  Earlier
# releases' hashes are not kept here: a path listed twice cannot be
# checked.  Release history is prose - CHECKSUMS.txt and APPLY.txt.
#
# Covers every built or recovered binary under OUT/ and toolkit/, plus
# every file changed in v0.3.4 and v0.3.5.  101 files.  2026-09-22.
#
# This manifest EXCLUDES the files CLEANUP RETIRE deletes, so it passes
# whether or not that has run.  It cannot tell you they are still there.
# 'CLEANUP STRAY' and 'git status' can.

